{"seq":1,"slug":"real-user-monitoring","title":"真实用户监控（RUM）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/frontend-client/real-user-monitoring","wordCount":1419,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"真实用户监控-rum\">真实用户监控（RUM）</h1><p>Lighthouse 给你 100 分不代表用户体验好——它只是在一台高配机器上模拟了一次加载。真实用户监控（Real User Monitoring, RUM）采集的是你的真实用户、在他们的真实设备、真实网络条件下的实际体验数据。2026 年的 CrUX（Chrome User Experience Report）数据显示，仅 48% 的移动站点通过全部三项 Core Web Vitals——Lab 测试和 Field 数据之间的鸿沟从未如此明显。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RUM 的核心概念区分了“谁在测、测什么、数据落在哪一层”：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>在 RUM 中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Field Data</td>\n<td>真实用户设备的实测数据</td>\n<td>RUM 的数据本质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lab Data</td>\n<td>受控环境模拟的数据</td>\n<td>Synthetic 的数据本质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CrUX</td>\n<td>Chrome 真实用户性能报告</td>\n<td>公开的 Field 基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P75</td>\n<td>第 75 百分位</td>\n<td>Google 排名的评估口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样率</td>\n<td>上报事件占全部事件的比例</td>\n<td>成本与覆盖的平衡点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>traceparent</td>\n<td>W3C 传播头</td>\n<td>前端与后端 trace 打通的纽带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>consent 状态</td>\n<td>用户是否同意数据采集</td>\n<td>隐私合规的门控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RUM 与 Synthetic 的边界是根本性的：前者告诉你“用户实际体验如何”，后者告诉你“这次改动是否引入退化”——两者回答不同问题，不能相互替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rum-与-synthetic-monitoring-的互补关系\">RUM 与 Synthetic Monitoring 的互补关系</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>RUM（Field Data）</th>\n<th>Synthetic Monitoring（Lab Data）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据来源</td>\n<td>真实用户浏览器</td>\n<td>受控环境的模拟代理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖范围</td>\n<td>所有页面、所有设备、所有地区</td>\n<td>预定义的关键路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变量控制</td>\n<td>不可控（网络、设备千差万别）</td>\n<td>完全控制（标准化对比）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>发现真实问题、P75 性能评估</td>\n<td>回归检测、部署前验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表工具</td>\n<td>web-vitals.js、SpeedCurve、Vercel Speed Insights</td>\n<td>Lighthouse CI、WebPageTest</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两者不是竞争关系：Synthetic 做<strong>回归守门</strong>（部署前 CI 中跑，确保不引入退化），RUM 做<strong>真相度量</strong>（Google 排名、用户体验决策用的是 CrUX 的 P75 Field 数据）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rum-数据采集架构\">RUM 数据采集架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    B[Browser&lt;br/&gt;web-vitals + OTel JS SDK] --&gt;|OTLP/HTTP&lt;br/&gt;fetch keepalive| G[OTel Collector&lt;br/&gt;Gateway]&#10;    G --&gt;|Traces| T[Tempo]&#10;    G --&gt;|Metrics| M[Mimir]&#10;    G --&gt;|Logs| L[Loki]&#10;    M --&gt; D[Grafana Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;RUM Overview]&#10;    T --&gt; D\">graph LR\n    B[Browser&lt;br/&gt;web-vitals + OTel JS SDK] --&gt;|OTLP/HTTP&lt;br/&gt;fetch keepalive| G[OTel Collector&lt;br/&gt;Gateway]\n    G --&gt;|Traces| T[Tempo]\n    G --&gt;|Metrics| M[Mimir]\n    G --&gt;|Logs| L[Loki]\n    M --&gt; D[Grafana Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;RUM Overview]\n    T --&gt; D</pre><p>关键设计决策：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>传输协议</strong>：浏览器环境无法使用 gRPC，采用 OTLP/HTTP（JSON 或 Protobuf）。使用 <code>navigator.sendBeacon()</code> 或 <code>fetch({ keepalive: true })</code> 确保页面卸载时数据不丢失</li>\n<li><strong>采样率</strong>：高流量站点建议 1–10% 采样（Head Sampling），但错误 session 100% 保留</li>\n<li><strong>隐私合规</strong>：RUM 数据天然包含用户行为轨迹，需遵循 GDPR/CCPA——IP 匿名化、不采集个人身份信息、提供 opt-out 机制</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"核心度量体系\">核心度量体系</h2><p>RUM 需要采集的维度分为三层：</p>\n<h3 id=\"性能层-performance\">性能层（Performance）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>好</th>\n<th>差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LCP</td>\n<td>最大内容绘制时间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 2.5s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>4.0</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 4.0s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INP</td>\n<td>交互到下一次绘制延迟</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>200</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 200ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>500</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 500ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLS</td>\n<td>累计布局偏移</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTFB</td>\n<td>首字节时间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>800</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 800ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1800</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 1800ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1800</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FCP</td>\n<td>首次内容绘制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.8</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 1.8s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3.0</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 3.0s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"行为层-engagement\">行为层（Engagement）</h3><ul>\n<li>页面停留时长、滚动深度、交互频率</li>\n<li>Session 回放（录屏重现用户操作路径）</li>\n<li>愤怒点击（Rage Click）检测——用户短时间内多次点击同一元素</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"环境层-context\">环境层（Context）</h3><ul>\n<li>设备类型（手机/平板/桌面）、操作系统、浏览器版本</li>\n<li>网络类型（4G/WiFi/离线缓存）、有效连接类型（ECT）</li>\n<li>地理位置（CDN 节点选择与就近路由）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"从-rum-数据到-trace-的跨层关联\">从 RUM 数据到 Trace 的跨层关联</h2><p>RUM 的真正威力在于与后端 trace 打通。当用户在浏览器中发起一个请求：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>OTel JS SDK 创建一个 root span（<code>document.load</code> 或 <code>user.click</code>）</li>\n<li>发出的 <code>fetch</code> 请求被 <code>XMLHttpRequest</code> / <code>fetch</code> instrumentation 拦截，注入 <code>traceparent</code> header</li>\n<li>后端服务提取 <code>traceparent</code>，创建 child span</li>\n<li>结果：一条 trace 从用户的浏览器按钮点击开始，穿过 API Gateway、微服务、数据库，形成完整链路</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { WebTracerProvider } from &#39;@opentelemetry/sdk-trace-web&#39;;&#10;import { ZoneContextManager } from &#39;@opentelemetry/context-zone&#39;;&#10;import { FetchInstrumentation } from &#39;@opentelemetry/instrumentation-fetch&#39;;&#10;import { DocumentLoadInstrumentation } from &#39;@opentelemetry/instrumentation-document-load&#39;;&#10;import { OTLPTraceExporter } from &#39;@opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http&#39;;&#10;&#10;const provider = new WebTracerProvider({&#10;  resource: { attributes: { &#39;service.name&#39;: &#39;web-frontend&#39; } },&#10;});&#10;&#10;provider.addSpanProcessor(&#10;  new BatchSpanProcessor(&#10;    new OTLPTraceExporter({&#10;      url: &#39;https://collector.example.com/v1/traces&#39;,&#10;    }),&#10;  ),&#10;);&#10;&#10;provider.register({ contextManager: new ZoneContextManager() });&#10;&#10;registerInstrumentations({&#10;  instrumentations: [&#10;    new FetchInstrumentation({&#10;      propagateTraceHeaderCorsUrls: [/api\\.example\\.com/],&#10;    }),&#10;    new DocumentLoadInstrumentation(),&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { WebTracerProvider } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/sdk-trace-web'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ZoneContextManager } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/context-zone'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { FetchInstrumentation } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/instrumentation-fetch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { DocumentLoadInstrumentation } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/instrumentation-document-load'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { OTLPTraceExporter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> provider</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WebTracerProvider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resource: { attributes: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'service.name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'web-frontend'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">provider.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addSpanProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BatchSpanProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OTLPTraceExporter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://collector.example.com/v1/traces'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">provider.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ contextManager: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ZoneContextManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerInstrumentations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instrumentations: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FetchInstrumentation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      propagateTraceHeaderCorsUrls: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">api</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">example</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">com</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DocumentLoadInstrumentation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>CORS 注意事项</strong>：跨域请求需要后端在 <code>Access-Control-Allow-Headers</code> 中允许 <code>traceparent</code> 和 <code>tracestate</code>。否则浏览器的 CORS preflight 会阻止 context propagation。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高流量场景的-rum-架构优化\">高流量场景的 RUM 架构优化</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>日均 RUM 事件量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>DAU</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>人均页面浏览数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>每页事件数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>采样率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{日均 RUM 事件量} = \\text{DAU} \\times \\text{人均页面浏览数} \\times \\text{每页事件数} \\times \\text{采样率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">日均</span><span class=\"mord\"> RUM </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">事件量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DAU</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">人均页面浏览数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每页事件数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">采样率</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以一个 DAU = 1000 万、人均 5 页、每页 10 个事件、10% 采样率的站点为例：日均 5000 万条 RUM 事件。这个量级需要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>客户端缓冲</strong>：<code>BatchSpanProcessor</code> 在内存中攒批（默认 512 span/批），每 5 秒或满批发送</li>\n<li><strong>压缩传输</strong>：OTLP/HTTP 开启 gzip，典型压缩比 5:1</li>\n<li><strong>Collector 水平扩展</strong>：Gateway 模式下 3+ 副本，按 trace_id 一致性哈希分配</li>\n<li><strong>存储分层</strong>：热数据（7d）存 SSD，温数据（30d）存对象存储</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"隐私与合规\">隐私与合规</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合规要求</th>\n<th>RUM 实现策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GDPR 第 6 条（合法基础）</td>\n<td>基于正当利益（性能监控）或获取明确同意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP 匿名化</td>\n<td>Collector 层截断 IP 后两段（<code>/16</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cookie 同意</td>\n<td>RUM SDK 初始化前检查 consent 状态，未同意则不加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据主体请求（DSAR）</td>\n<td>RUM 数据不关联 PII，按 session_id 删除即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据保留</td>\n<td>原始事件保留 30 天，聚合指标保留 13 个月</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于 RUM 中错误的专项处理策略，参见 <a href=\"frontend-error-tracking\">前端错误追踪</a>。性能指标的深度解读与优化方法，参见 <a href=\"web-vitals-performance\">Web Vitals 与性能度量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>RUM 采集真实用户、真实设备、真实网络条件下的体验数据，与 Synthetic Monitoring 形成互补：后者做回归守门，前者做真相度量。落地时的三个关键决策是传输协议（OTLP/HTTP + sendBeacon）、采样率（高流量站点 1–10%，错误 session 100% 保留）与隐私合规（IP 匿名化、consent 门控、按 session_id 删除）。RUM 的真正价值在于跨层关联——用 <code>traceparent</code> 把浏览器的 root span 与后端微服务的 child span 串成完整链路，让“用户点击慢”能被确定性定位到具体服务。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"真实用户监控（RUM）","id":"真实用户监控-rum"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"RUM 与 Synthetic Monitoring 的互补关系","id":"rum-与-synthetic-monitoring-的互补关系"},{"level":2,"text":"RUM 数据采集架构","id":"rum-数据采集架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心度量体系","id":"核心度量体系"},{"level":3,"text":"性能层（Performance）","id":"性能层-performance"},{"level":3,"text":"行为层（Engagement）","id":"行为层-engagement"},{"level":3,"text":"环境层（Context）","id":"环境层-context"},{"level":2,"text":"从 RUM 数据到 Trace 的跨层关联","id":"从-rum-数据到-trace-的跨层关联"},{"level":2,"text":"高流量场景的 RUM 架构优化","id":"高流量场景的-rum-架构优化"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私与合规","id":"隐私与合规"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可观测性驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/foundations/observability-driven-development"},"next":{"title":"前端错误追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/frontend-client/frontend-error-tracking"}}